{"reviewId": "237554720_88FD8MdlE", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 8, "content": "因为 美元↓⇒商品名义价格↑（eg.以前1美元买100kg，现在美元跌，1美元只能买90kg，于是商品标价会提高）\n所以 本来会认为 美元跌 → 大宗商品（石油、黄金、铜）美元计价上涨。\n这是 短期的标价效应\n但如果美元跌是因为：\n美国资产泡沫下跌\n全球金融体系震荡\n美国需求下降\n中国出口受冲击\n全球增长放缓\n那资源需求会掉 需求↓⇒商品价格↓\n且这种效应 比 美元贬值推高标价 更强 所以长期造成衰退", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "短期内，标价因素的确可能会导致资源品价格上升甚至创出新高，但长期看，经济衰退对资源需求和价格的作用会更加深远。", "range": "21118-21173", "chapterName": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "chapterIdx": 8, "reviewId": "237554720_88FD8MdlE", "userVid": 237554720, "topics": [], "createTime": 1777258431, "userEditTime": 1778757231, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "03 “色即是空” 世界经济的共生模式与国际资源品价格调节新机制", "author": {"userVid": 237554720, "name": "Flaaaaaaaaash", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0022-NhbHkFzMelK60ty1tUcTH10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "So it goes", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "永远真实 保持热爱", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-1000", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 1000}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 21, "likes": [{"userVid": 4305291, "name": "杀毛三", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaELf9zgLhkBHicODC78USIpG6iasvtsXa2N9KsCMjFyheOiazZCtCohCZfNj0hgC13LX7KIR0l1ACYSDSnQTuragJAfPyqwiaPUpg9WbunW8NuF6Vw/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-100", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "l